WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
Only about a tenth of the energy passes to each level.

2
00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:08.500
Phytoplankton capture twenty thousand kilojoules from sunlight.

3
00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:16.706
Krill get about ten percent; the rest is used for living or lost as heat.

4
00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:26.028
Each step keeps about ten percent, so the penguin gets only twenty kilojoules.
